 "text": "-->\nGovernment | Saline County, MO\ntop of page\nHOME\nElected Offices\nAssessor\nAuditor\nCircuit Clerk\nCollector\nCommission\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nCounty Departments\nBuilding and Grounds\nEmergency Management Agency\nHuman Resources\nRoad and Bridge\nElections\nAbout Us\nMore\nCounty Links\nDirectory\nHistorical Preservation\nPrevious Office Holders\nQ & A\nVeterans Memory Walk of Honor\nWelcome to Saline County, Missouri!\nSaline County Emergency Alert System\nOn July 1, 2026, Saline County Emergency Management will be launching a new text, voice, email and social media emergency alert system that will notify Saline County residents of emergency situations. The Regroup platform will replace the Rave platform that Saline County currently uses.\n​\nClick the link below to sign up:\n​\nhttps://embeds.regroupcloud.com/orgs/SalineCOMOEM/signup_embed\nCourtesy of The Marshall Democrat-News\nCounty Office Phone Numbers\nCounty Directory\nEnjoy the convenience of paying your taxes online!\nPay taxes\nUS 65 and I-70 Junction Development\nCommunity Involvement\nBRIDGE PROJECTS\nJail & Justice Center 2023 Renovation\nThe Saline County Courthouse will be closed on all State and Federal holidays\n2026 Holiday Schedule\nBoards and Commissions\nResolutions\nCourthouse Roof Renovation\nPartial payment and prepayment of personal property taxes\nPrepayment Tax Info\nClick the button below to view information on voter registration, and polling places\nElections Home\nMSDC's Mission is to strengthen Saline County by supporting existing businesses and industry and recruiting new business and industry to Saline County.\nMSDC Website\nMU Extension in Saline County\nExtension Website\n﻿﻿© 2026 by Saline County Commission. All rights reserved.\nbottom of page",
